1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:03,220
Part ten. Projects and tasks.

2
00:00:04,250 --> 00:00:07,564
Every confirmed order becomes a project.

3
00:00:07,564 --> 00:00:13,365
The Board shows them by stage: planning, design, material procurement,

4
00:00:13,365 --> 00:00:17,425
installation, testing, net metering and handover.

5
00:00:18,330 --> 00:00:24,682
Open a project to see the customer, capacity, manager, target date, budget,

6
00:00:24,682 --> 00:00:31,373
progress and milestones, with buttons to schedule the installation, add a task,

7
00:00:31,373 --> 00:00:34,168
send material or make an invoice.

8
00:00:35,050 --> 00:00:39,483
Edit the project as work moves: tick the milestones done,

9
00:00:39,483 --> 00:00:43,760
update the stage and the progress percentage, and save.

10
00:00:44,650 --> 00:00:49,489
Tap Add task for anything someone must do: order the structure,

11
00:00:49,489 --> 00:00:52,868
get the design approved, book the net meter.

12
00:00:52,868 --> 00:00:56,248
Give it a priority, a person and a due date.

13
00:00:57,130 --> 00:01:01,902
The task board shows everyone's work as To do, In progress and Done.

14
00:01:01,902 --> 00:01:04,569
Move a card when the work is finished.

15
00:01:05,700 --> 00:01:08,159
Next video: Products and stock.

